<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>first day of four-day Supersport Series cricket matches on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>In Durban: Natal 282 (Dale Benkenstein 100, Neil Johnson</p>
<p>50).</p>
<p>Free State 16 for one.</p>
<p>In Port Elizabeth: Western Province 150 for one (Desmond</p>
<p>Haynes</p>
<p>66 not out) against Eastern Province</p>
